====== Buffalo LinkStation LS220DE ======
{{:media:buffalo:ls421de:ls220de.jpg?nolink&160|}}

This is a low-cost dual-port SATA NAS box. Very similar to [[toh:buffalo:ls421de|LS421DE]] but with lower hardware specs. 
It comes with one 1GbE network port and one USB 2.0 host port on the back.

